{{protected page|small=yes}}
Lists one template's rules page on [[User:ParamBot/Rules]], with the revision of it that a template editor has approved. [[User:ParamBot|ParamBot]] reads the wikitext of [[User:ParamBot/Rules]] and uses exactly that revision of the rules page, never a newer one. This template only changes how the list looks, so editing it can't change what the bot does.

== Usage ==
Put one on each line under the <code>== Active ==</code> or <code>== Inactive ==</code> heading of [[User:ParamBot/Rules]]:
<pre>
* {{User:ParamBot/LinkRule|Infobox station|1234567890}}
</pre>
* The first parameter is the template's name, as in the rules page's title: <code>Infobox station</code> for [[User:ParamBot/Rules/Infobox station]].
* The second is the approved revision. To find it, open the rules page's history and click the date of the version you approve: the number after <code>oldid=</code> in the address is the revision. Or use ''Permanent link'' in the ''Tools'' menu while viewing the page.

To approve newer edits to a rules page, check them with the ''changes since approval'' link, then change the number to the page's latest revision.

== Examples ==
* {{User:ParamBot/LinkRule|Infobox airport|1377354251}}
* {{User:ParamBot/LinkRule|Infobox airport}}
